---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - HERITAGE APEX">
    <main class="container mx-auto py-16 px-6 max-w-4xl text-gray-300">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-[var(--accent-orange)]">Privacy Policy</h1>
        
        <div class="space-y-8 leading-relaxed">
            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-white">1. Confidentiality</h2>
                <p>
                    Any information, which is either held by <strong>HERITAGE APEX</strong> or which you provide to HERITAGE APEX, will be regarded by HERITAGE APEX as personal information and, subject to the Terms and Conditions, be treated as confidential.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-white">2. Use of Personal Information</h2>
                <p>
                    HERITAGE APEX will only use your personal information in the ordinary course of its business and for the purposes of providing information as would have been requested through subscription to HERITAGE APEX material or email alerts.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-white">3. Non-Release of Information to Third Parties</h2>
                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <p>
                        <strong>3.1</strong> HERITAGE APEX will not sell, rent, or provide your personal information to unauthorised entities or to third parties for their independent use without your consent. HERITAGE APEX may, however, share your personal information with its affiliates, business partners, and subsidiaries in the ordinary course of its business. If HERITAGE APEX does pass your personal information on to its affiliates, business partners, and/or subsidiaries, it will make them aware of the provisions of this privacy policy.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <strong>3.2</strong> HERITAGE APEX will release your personal information to a party if it believes that it is required by law or by a competent court to do so, in compliance with applicable laws and regulations in the Sultanate of Oman. HERITAGE APEX will also disclose your personal information if it believes, in its sole discretion, that this is necessary to prevent or lessen any unlawful or harmful actions.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-white">4. Updating Personal Information</h2>
                <p>
                    If you would like to update or correct any of your personal information held by HERITAGE APEX, kindly contact HERITAGE APEX’s department at 
                    <a href="mailto:info@heritageapex.com" class="text-[var(--accent-orange)] underline">info@heritageapex.com</a> 
                    and we will endeavour to update and correct your personal information.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-white">5. Non-Warranty</h2>
                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <p>
                        <strong>5.1</strong> If you disclose any personal information to a third party, such as one of HERITAGE APEX’s affiliates or an entity which operates a website linked to this website or anyone other than HERITAGE APEX, you must be aware that HERITAGE APEX does not regulate or control how that third party uses your personal information. You should always ensure that you read the privacy policy of any third party, as their privacy policy will be applicable.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <strong>5.2</strong> Where your personal information is accessed or used by a third party through the HERITAGE APEX website, you will release HERITAGE APEX from any liability, financial or physical, as a result of the use of such information. You will also release HERITAGE APEX from the obligation to pay you any benefits or profits gained by any third parties as a result of the use of your personal information obtained via HERITAGE APEX’s website.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-white">6. Assent to Terms of Privacy Policy</h2>
                <p>
                    By using the HERITAGE APEX website you acknowledge that you have read the terms of this privacy policy and that you agree to the use of User Data for the purposes set out above. Please note that HERITAGE APEX may amend this Privacy Policy at any time in accordance with applicable regulations.
                </p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>